elvaggio.\" Tuttavia, la pioggia incessante trasforma il loro campo in una palude, quindi devono prendersi una pausa inaspettata. E quando finalmente arriva il sole, una banda di ragazzi più grandi ma anche più stupidi ha appena preso il controllo del campo. Non lo restituiranno a meno che non perdano una partita contro i ragazzi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Wild Soccer Bunch","overview":"The school year is over and for a diverse group of carefree kids, soccer is king! These kids believe that they are the local gold team and there is nothing they like more than improving their game. \"If you want to be cool, you should be wild.\" However, the relentless rain turns their field into a swamp, so they have to take an unexpected break. And when the sun finally comes, a gang of older, bigger and dumber boys has just taken over the field. They won't give it back unless they lose a match against the kids.","tagline":"It's all good as long as you're wild!"},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Leon, Fabi, Marlon, Raban, Juli, Joschka und Maxi sind die besten Freunde aller Zeiten. Fussball ist ihr Ding, der Bolzplatz ihr Revier. Das Leben der wilden Kerle ist in diesem heissen Sommer wie ein Paradies: Kioskbesitzer Willi sorgt für Apfelschorle und die Eltern geben Ruhe. Wären da nicht der dicke Michi und seine Gang, “die unbesiegbaren Sieger”: älter, grösser und definitiv gefährlich, keinesfalls zu unterschätzen! Das Drehbuch basiert auf der erfolgreichen Buchserie “Die Wilden Fussballkerle”.","tagline":"Alles ist gut, solange du wild bist!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jrYqdIOF1EOoBQSQbkIU88NJy9n.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4GSaYgyx9zLnLVJ31wsnqejfJBn.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":10755,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing"